
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Golden Search</title>
<style>
body {
  background: #080808;
  color: #FFD700;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 60px 15px;
}
h1 {
  font-size: 38px;
  text-shadow: 0 0 20px #FFD700;
}
input {
  padding: 15px;
  width: 75%;
  border: 2px solid gold;
  border-radius: 20px;
}
button {
  background: gold;
  color: black;
  padding: 15px 30px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 20px;
  margin-top: 15px;
  font-weight: bold;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>GOLDEN SEARCH</h1>
<p>مرحباً بك في محرك البحث الذهبي</p>
<form action="https://www.google.com/search"
      method="GET">
<input name="q" placeholder="ابحث هنا..." required>
<br>
<button type="submit">بحث Google</button>
</form>
</body>
</html>
